                                                "sense_id": "b410a4b4-e6ae-3bb4-b1f9-b9eea581f4af",
                                                "text": "This flow overlies fossil vertebrate-bearing volcaniclastic sediments that include a grayish-black vitric tuff that may be correlative with the unit A1 tuff at Dmanisi."
